<title>SINGAPORE: ST AEROSPACE TO MERGE SHARE TRANCHES.</title>
<headline>ST AEROSPACE TO MERGE SHARE TRANCHES.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Aerospace Ltd said on Wednesday that with effect from Thursday August 14 its foreign and local share tranches would be merged.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112</p>
